      en: ["The terraces have a documented history of over 500 years.", "The site covers an agricultural area of approximately 20 hectares.", "The slope of the terraced fields ranges from 15 to 30 degrees.", "Designated as National Agricultural Heritage No. 3 in 2013.", "A traditional canal system relies entirely on natural spring water.", "The area is a key habitat for the endangered gold-spotted pond frog."],
